    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Display live or historical precious metal prices (Gold, Silver, Platinum, Palladium, &#8230;) in over 150+ currencies<br />\nor<br />\nDisplay live or historical foreign exchange (forex) rates in over 150+ currencies</p>\n<p>Use shortcode [metalpriceapi] to display metal rates on your wp website.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://metalpriceapi.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Official Website</a></p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Wordpress Plugin Tutorial for live gold prices and foreign exchange rates\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ykpHERqO_gM?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>Shortcode Customization:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>{{symbol}}</li>\n<li>{{base}}</li>\n<li>{{price_round}}</li>\n<li>{{date}}</li>\n<li>{{date_format}}</li>\n<li>{{date_timezone}}</li>\n<li>{{unit}}</li>\n<li>{{purity}}</li>\n<li>{{operation}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Display Customization:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>{{base}}</li>\n<li>{{timestamp}}</li>\n<li>{{price}}</li>\n<li>{{symbol}}</li>\n<li>{{date}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Detailed instructions included upon plugin installation.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Upload the extracted plugin files to the /wp-content/plugins directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</p>\n<p>Activate the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; menu in WordPress and then enter your metalpriceapi.com API key.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Version bump</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add metalpriceapi_change shortcode</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated documentation</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add timezone support</li>\n<li>Updated documentation</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated documentation</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Version bump</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add days support</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add operation support</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add carat support</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update Readme</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update Readme</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update Readme</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update Readme</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add units and purity API params</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Display live or historical precious metal prices (Gold, Silver, Platinum, Palladium, ...) in over 150+ currencies",
    "description": "<p>Display live or historical precious metal prices (Gold, Silver, Platinum, Palladium, &#8230;) in over 150+ currencies<br />\nor<br />\nDisplay live or historical foreign exchange (forex) rates in over 150+ currencies</p>\n<p>Use shortcode [metalpriceapi] to display metal rates on your wp website.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://metalpriceapi.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Official Website</a></p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Wordpress Plugin Tutorial for live gold prices and foreign exchange rates\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ykpHERqO_gM?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>Shortcode Customization:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>{{symbol}}</li>\n<li>{{base}}</li>\n<li>{{price_round}}</li>\n<li>{{date}}</li>\n<li>{{date_format}}</li>\n<li>{{date_timezone}}</li>\n<li>{{unit}}</li>\n<li>{{purity}}</li>\n<li>{{operation}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Display Customization:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>{{base}}</li>\n<li>{{timestamp}}</li>\n<li>{{price}}</li>\n<li>{{symbol}}</li>\n<li>{{date}}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Detailed instructions included upon plugin installation.</p>\n",
